*.db
# Timestamped DB backups (prod.db.bak-2026…, prod.db.backup-2026…) — the old
# `*.db.bak.*` pattern needed a trailing dot and let these through UNIGNORED,
# i.e. one `git add -A` away from committing the whole database.
*.db.bak*
*.db.backup*
*.db-journal
*.tsbuildinfo

